GerClaw voice is derived from the following community designs:

- dsh-talk 0.1.3, commit e50a5bca708b629a558084f57a7134ff6366f482
  (Apache-2.0): session projection, speak-to-interrupt, lifecycle and sanitization
  design. Source: https://github.com/PerryLink/dsh-talk
- dsh-speech-plugin, commit bcfb8d1ee53bc92af74aa4d10757db6f0b976261
  (MIT): no-server WebSocket upgrade bridge and browser PCM streaming design.
  Source: https://github.com/Command-Awesome/dsh-speech-plugin

GerClaw replaces both providers with the official Qianwen realtime ASR/TTS
protocol, limits speech to the chat composer, and does not persist source audio.
The corresponding upstream licenses are retained in LICENSES/.
